# Vercel upload limit is 15k files. Before the NCERT extraction (books/) and QA
# output (artifacts/) existed, the full workspace uploaded fine — so exclude only
# the two huge directories plus caches. Everything else (apps/*, packages/*,
# public/downloads/sanroai.apk) was part of every successful deploy.
.git
books
artifacts
releases
**/.expo
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo
